lers are unprepared, highly motivated, and open to flexible financing terms you can negotiate on day one.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0qOvqLM_q_childItem_1","label":"gg0qOvqLM_q_childItem_1","default":"<p>Most buyers spend years mindlessly scrolling crowded broker sites competing with thousands of amateurs — and never close a single deal. This blueprint levels the playing field.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0qOvqLM_q_childItem_2","label":"gg0qOvqLM_q_childItem_2","default":"<p>The buyers who win are not the ones with the most cash. They're the ones who know how to structure a deal so the business pays for itself. This manual is the exact playbook they use.</p>"}],
